{"id":2272,"date":"2024-07-04T08:10:44","date_gmt":"2024-07-04T01:10:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/?p=2272"},"modified":"2024-07-04T08:15:40","modified_gmt":"2024-07-04T01:15:40","slug":"perpanjangan-penandatangan-mou-antara-politeknik-stmi-jakarta-dengan-pt-denso-indonesia","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/perpanjangan-penandatangan-mou-antara-politeknik-stmi-jakarta-dengan-pt-denso-indonesia\/","title":{"rendered":"Perpanjangan Penandatangan MoU antara Politeknik STMI Jakarta dengan PT. Denso Indonesia"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Halo Sobat STMI!<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Pada hari ini, Rabu 3 Juli 2024 telah dilaksanakan Perpanjangan Penandatangan MoU antara Politeknik STMI Jakarta dengan PT. Denso Indonesia dan disaksikan oleh Sekretaris BPSDMI<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2273 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture14-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture14-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture14-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture14-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture14-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture14-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Penandatangan Mou dilakukan oleh Direktur Politeknik STMI, Bapak Amrin Rapi dengan Direktur HR PT Denso Indonesia, Bapak Subrono dan disaksikan oleh Sekretaris BPSDMI, Bapak Jonni Afrizon<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2275 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture16-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Picture16-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stm